<style>
  body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    color: #333333;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
  }
  .email-container {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: auto;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }
  .button {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: #007bff;
    color: #ffffff !important;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .footer {
    margin-top: 30px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #999999;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
<div class="email-container">
  <h2>Registration Approved</h2>
  <p>Hi <strong><%= @user.full_name %></strong>,</p>
  <p>We’re happy to inform you that your registration with <strong>brgyhealth.top</strong> has been approved by our admin team.</p>
  <p>You can now log in and start using your account:</p>
  <%= link_to "Log In", new_user_session_url(subdomain: @user.barangay&.subdomain), class: "button" %>
  <p>If you have any questions, feel free to contact us at <a href="mailto:junjunpojr@gmail.com">junjunpojr@gmail.com</a>.</p>
  <p>Welcome aboard!<br>
    <strong>brgyhealth.top Team</strong></p>
</div>
<div class="footer">
  &copy; <%= Time.current.year %> brgyhealth.top. All rights reserved.
</div>
